        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You copy the components of your spell before casting it from your database, maintaining a copy that duplicates the spell's effects. If your next action is to Cast a Spell of 4th rank or lower that has no duration, the spell's energy remains temporarily copied. You can Cast the Spell a second time before the end of your next turn without expending a spell slot.</p>"
